    "body_html": "<h2><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/7k6-y9k1FI0?si=6DslKdLF4F7QLu-W\" title=\"YouTube video player\"></iframe></h2>\n<h2>The Next Step in the Game Breaker Legacy.</h2>\n<p class=\"p1\">The Ebonite Game Breaker line has been synonymous with performance and value for more than a decade, earning its reputation as one of the most reliable go-to options in bowling. The <span class=\"s1\"><b>GB5 Hybrid</b></span> continues that legacy, designed to perfectly complement the GB5 lineup and provide a natural follow-up to the GB5 Pearl. Its balanced, predictable motion makes it an ideal symmetrical option for bowlers needing to handle more oil.</p>\n<h2 class=\"p1\">Specifications</h2>\n<table width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Performance</strong></td>\n<td>Mid<br></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Part Number</strong></td>\n<td>60-108577-93X</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<strong>Color</strong><br>\n</td>\n<td>Sky Blue / Black<br></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Core</strong></td>\n<td>Enhanced V2<br></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Coverstock</strong></td>\n<td>HK22 - GB 12.7 Hybrid<br></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Cover Type</strong></td>\n<td>Hybrid Reactive</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Finish</strong></td>\n<td>500, 2000 Siaair Micro Pad</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Weights</strong></td>\n<td>16-10 Pounds</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Lane Condition</strong></td>\n<td>Medium to oily</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Reaction</strong></td>\n<td>Strong mid-lane and backend<br></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Warranty</strong></td>\n<td>Two years from purchase date </td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Release Date</strong></td>\n<td>March 19, 2026</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>Core Numbers</h2>\n<table style=\"width: 50.7725%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 23%;\">\n<p><strong>Weight</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 19%;\">\n<p><strong>RG</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.7218%;\">\n<p><str